WEBVTT

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:32.880
I'm home.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.250
Many thanks to you, as well.

00:01:47.050 --> 00:01:48.600
Yes, of course.

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:51.210
I just got back.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:54.910
No, it's all right.

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:57.830
Yes.

00:01:58.690 --> 00:02:00.290
What? She collapsed?!

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:03.610
Oh... But she is conscious, right?

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:06.700
Yes. Yes.

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:07.970
And now?

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:11.860
I see... I'm so glad.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.370
Yes, I understand.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:20.360
<b>Fujitaka    At the university. Be home by 5. 

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:17.290
I'd appreciate it if you would.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:20.350
Yes, thank you so much.

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.140
Goodbye.

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:28.700
Who collapsed? Sakura?

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:32.490
Yeah, but they had a doctor 
check her right away.

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:33.240
Should we go get her?

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:36.670
He's having someone drive her home.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:38.550
She's fine now.

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:42.830
She laughed and told him she probably 
just didn't get enough sleep.

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:46.020
She was probably out, 
getting into something again...

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:47.120
Huh?

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.590
Nothing. She was at Mom's 
grandpa's house, right?

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:52.080
Yeah.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:56.570
He said he had two things related to 
Nadeshiko-san he wanted to give her.

00:02:57.180 --> 00:03:00.020
But one of the two is much too big,

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:04.420
so I asked him to hold on to it for now.

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:05.910
Too big?

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.810
It's the house she's visiting now.

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:09.150
Huh?

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:13.420
It was one of Nadeshiko-san's 
favorite secondary homes,

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:16.520
so he wanted to give it to Sakura-san...

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:18.910
A house? To a middle schooler?

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:22.790
Yeah, which is why I asked him not to.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:24.490
Want some tea?

00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:25.420
Sure.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:25.940
Coming up.

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.260
I have some Japanese sweets, too.

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:29.670
Great.

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:35.690
<b>Sakura, the Mirror, and the Key of Memories</b>

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:31.570
How many do you want?

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:33.030
How many do you have for Sakura-san?

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:34.180
Four.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.680
I'll have two, then.

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:38.450
Let's make it a strong tea.

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:43.520
Is Great-Grandpa a lot like Mom?

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:46.280
I'm not sure...

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:49.250
I thought she looked a bit 
like him in the eyes,

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:53.290
but Sonomi-san says that Nadeshiko-san 
took after their grandmother.

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:57.040
Masaki-san said he'd love to meet you, too.

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:01.640
Maybe someday, if the timing works.

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:04.260
Being a bit shy?

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:11.770
You might be alike.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:13.040
Huh?

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:14.990
You and Masaki-san.

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:15.970
Me?

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:17.730
Yeah. You are.

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:21.180
I'll have to get you two 
side-by-side to check.

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:26.300
You are related, after all.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:28.160
It's only natural that 
you'd have similarities.

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:33.420
Lately, I've been thinking that 
Sakura is a lot like Mom, too.

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:38.540
I can see that. Sakura's smile 
looks more and more like hers.

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.970
And that sort of mysterious 
quality she has, too.

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:43.310
Huh?

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:47.270
Nadeshiko-san would talk to 
things that weren't there,

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:50.350
and try to reach an understanding 
with things that couldn't talk.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:51.990
She was a mysterious person.

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:55.340
Of course, that goes for you, too.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:59.400
Didn't you ever find any 
of that unbelievable?

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:01.820
Not at all.

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:05.700
But since I couldn't hear or 
sense any of those things,

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.020
I might have felt a little left out.

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:11.040
It's the same with Sakura-san.

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:13.640
I can't understand what's going on with her.

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:17.950
You know about Sakura?

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:20.730
Not in much detail, no.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:24.170
But I know it's something I can't fix,

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:28.180
and that she's had various troubles 
to deal with since fourth grade.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.820
At least, I had an inkling.

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:37.230
You really are amazing, Dad.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:38.690
How so?

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:41.910
You know something's going on,

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:44.310
but you just leave it to her 
and don't ask questions.

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:49.080
Well, this is Sakura-san we're talking about.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:56.590
She's a girl who knows how to treasure 
both herself and those around her.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.540
Besides, if anything were to happen,

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:01.830
she has a wonderful big brother!

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:06.120
I'm not very reliable myself.

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:11.470
These are so pretty. I almost 
can't bear to eat them.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:14.410
Starting next week, I'll be working once 
a week at the shop that makes them.

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.530
I'll buy more.

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:18.640
I appreciate that, but don't 
push yourself too hard.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.820
Get some more sleep.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.160
I'm all right now.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:34.670
And the doctor said there was 
nothing wrong with me.

00:06:35.050 --> 00:06:36.440
Yes, but...

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:40.030
So, um, you wanted to give me something?

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:49.480
Could you wait here for a moment?

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:50.290
Sure.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:55.880
You're not forcing yourself, are you?

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.190
Not at all.

00:06:57.460 --> 00:07:01.010
I'm sorry I made you worry, too.

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:03.180
Don't worry about me.

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:08.480
But seriously, if you have any pain 
or difficulty at all, tell me.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:11.270
Anything, no matter how small.

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:17.350
Same to you, Syaoran-kun...

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:25.960
I want you to tell me those things, too.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.420
I'm back.

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:37.160
Here, it is.

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:43.200
Open it.

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:51.590
A key?

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:58.800
From a very young age, 
Nadeshiko treasured that key.

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:02.970
My wife and I brought it back from England.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:06.780
<i>England...</i>

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:10.030
<i>That's where Hiiragizawa is, and...</i>

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:13.770
My name is Yuna D. Kaito.

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:15.760
The "D"?

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.560
Here, in England, there's a magic association

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:22.180
that grants its highest-ranked 
magic users the title of "D."

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:26.310
<i>Yuna D. Kaito...</i>

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:38.450
Akiho's butler might be a magician?

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:41.100
The house they live in

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:45.240
was once torn down and replaced 
with an amusement park.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:47.470
An amusement park?

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:51.050
Then, why does the same 
house stand there now?

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:51.970
Well...

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:57.090
That location is perfect for storing 
objects that hold a lot of power.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.380
The house's shape is ideal, as well.

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:01.710
Did some magician make it that way?

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:03.230
Most likely.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:06.790
Have you contacted that magic association?

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:10.540
Yes, though they didn't give 
much of a response.

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:12.840
But I did learn one thing.

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:14.120
What?

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:19.740
A year ago, Yuna D. Kaito was excommunicated.

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:21.900
From the association?

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:26.390
But as long as ya have strong magic 
and do what the association asks,

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:28.110
they'll overlook anything.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:29.860
It's crazy what their people get away with!

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:31.910
What'd he do to get excommunicated?

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:33.670
I don't know,

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:37.120
but I looked into it through another source.

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:40.110
I had the Li family help me.

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:42.010
The kid's mom, eh?

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:43.680
What did you learn?

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:49.870
He was excommunicated because 
he lost a magical relic

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:52.300
that was not to be removed 
from the association.

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:53.320
Huh?!

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.710
He lost it? What kinda klutz is he?

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:57.710
But that was only the official cause.

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:04.320
The rumors say he simply took it and left.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:08.090
Is that even allowed?

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:10.720
They would never allow it.

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:14.360
They cannot compel him to return it.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:15.250
Why not?

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:21.030
Because no one can defeat a 
magician with the "D" title.

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:26.050
The association was hiding that relic.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:28.850
That means it's probably taboo.

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:33.170
The association can do nothing

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:36.400
because they fear both his power 
and the chance that he'll use it.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.860
Just what kind of power does it have?

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:43.430
Is it very powerful?

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:48.400
If you're asking whether it is more 
powerful than I am now, then yes.

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:54.750
The Li family head tried to learn 
what his power is, but could not.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.950
Even the kid's mother couldn't do it?

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:03.270
Our master...

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:06.200
What of our master?

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:19.150
Sakura-san doesn't rely on objects 
someone else made.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:22.990
Nor is she even aware when she creates 
the cards that embody her magic.

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:26.990
In other words, she has created 
her own magical items.

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:33.080
So the power to show the events 
of the past is Sakura's own?

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.360
Why not tell us?

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:41.450
Sakura-san's power is strong, 
but it is still chaotic.

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:44.270
She cannot control it at all.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:49.880
Plus, I do not know what this 
Yuna D. Kaito is after.

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:55.430
It probably has something to do 
with Sakura-san's new cards.

00:11:57.680 --> 00:12:00.160
I get why ya wouldn't tell Sakura,

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:02.530
but why didn't ya tell me and Yue?

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:07.210
Your worry would have shown too 
easily in your faces and actions.

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:07.690
Huh?

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:10.750
But I've got a great poker face!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:14.410
Yes, you do. But Yue does not.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:15.090
What?

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:19.720
Oh, yeah, true. When it comes 
to Sakura, he gets kinda...

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:24.010
Wh-What's goin' on?

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:48.710
Eriol!

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:00.350
Can ya fight back?

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:03.680
We must discern where the attacker is, first.

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:05.720
You needn't do anything.

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:08.120
The attack is only targeting me.

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:09.790
But that's why ya need help!

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:17.300
I will do everything I can from here.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:23.160
Please help Sakura-san. 
And Syaoran Li, as well.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:25.560
Eriol!

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.630
This is quite a powerful enemy, Sakura-san.

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:09.980
Eriol!

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:12.780
The connection has been severed.

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:17.330
Then, I'll just call him again.

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:21.060
No, not that!

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:31.780
No dice... It won't even ring!

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.250
I cannot reach him, either.

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:34.760
Spinny... I'll try Spinny.

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.520
No good...

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.520
No luck with Ruby Moon, either.

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:44.010
What's goin' on?

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:47.510
It seems our real-life communication 
means have also been severed.

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:02.840
I expected no less of Mr. Eriol Hiiragizawa.

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:05.570
No wonder they say he is

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:09.170
one of the most powerful 
of all living magicians.

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:13.480
This watch that hadn't even been 
scratched, all this time,

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:15.730
has broken.

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:21.040
Still, I will obtain these new cards.

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:26.580
So I can use the relic I took 
from the association

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.640
to activate that magic spell.

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:37.560
Kaito-san...

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:45.160
Using any means possible to 
achieve your goal is fine.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:52.670
But don't lose sight of what's most 
important, Yuna D. Kaito.

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:02.050
Make sure you go to bed 
as soon as you get home.

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:05.180
I will. I'm sorry I worried you.

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:10.200
I should apologize for calling 
you here so suddenly.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:12.710
Thank you both for coming.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:15.010
Come again, sometime.

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:16.910
Sure, definitely!

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:34.840
I'll take good care of the key!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:06.420
<b>Kinomoto</b>

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:22.450
What is it?

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:26.950
I-Is there something on my face?

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:27.930
No.

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:31.830
I was just thinking that the Syaoran-kun I see

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:35.540
and the Syaoran-kun you 
see are so different...

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:42.200
I can see you in person, 
but if you want to see yourself,

00:17:42.530 --> 00:17:44.980
you have to use a mirror or something.

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:46.460
That's true.

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:48.700
Same goes for me.

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:54.170
I'm the one who understands myself least.

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:57.530
Maybe that's why I make everyone worry.

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:01.600
I wish I had a mirror...

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:04.430
One that would show the real me.

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:07.590
Then, maybe I would know

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:11.680
how to avoid making everyone worry, now.

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:13.700
Sakura...

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:17.340
Is this the right place?

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.650
Thank you for the ride.

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:32.460
Well, get some rest.

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.060
I will. Thanks.

00:18:34.060 --> 00:18:35.450
See you tomorrow.

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:38.760
Huh?

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:40.390
What's wrong?

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.050
Oh... Nothing.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:44.400
See you.

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:45.510
Huh?

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:48.690
My house... is gone.

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:52.720
Why...

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:55.240
Sakura?

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:56.690
It's backwards!

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:58.030
Huh?

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.890
My house is flipped around!

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:02.780
<b>otomoniK</b>

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:04.000
Is this...

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:06.030
I think it's a card.

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:10.800
It's okay. No one's around.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:12.090
Yeah.

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:15.090
<i>Release!</i>

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:25.050
<i>Force without master,</i>

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:28.270
<i>heed the call of my Staff of Dreams, 
and become my power!</i>

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:29.690
<i>Secure!</i>

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:50.920
"Mirror"...

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:54.750
<b>Mirror</b>

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:54.300
Mirror.

00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:57.640
The Sakura Cards had a Mirror, too.

00:19:58.290 --> 00:19:59.040
And...

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.240
The picture looks similar.

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:07.370
<i>She's the one creating the cards,</i>

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:10.040
<i>so it makes sense that some 
have similar pictures.</i>

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:13.810
<i>Plus, we just had that 
conversation in the car,</i>

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:15.900
<i>and she made a card that relates to it.</i>

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:18.070
Syaoran-kun!

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:18.820
What?

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:20.820
Mind if I try it?

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:23.980
<i>Flight!</i>

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:33.750
Would you help me out for a bit?

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:37.840
Stay there.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:43.050
<b>Mirror</b>

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:47.780
Reflect the card's magical 
power like a mirror.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:51.510
<i>Mirror!</i>

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:07.460
It worked!

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:14.410
Okay, I'll use this one, and...

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:22.810
Let's go!

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:23.780
Huh?

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:28.640
Syaoran-kun!

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:31.180
This is pretty hard...

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:34.960
Thanks.

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:38.300
Since it's a mirror, I thought it might 
be able to reflect magic, too.

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:40.810
I'm glad it worked!

00:21:41.560 --> 00:21:45.580
<i>It worked because your magic 
is just that powerful.</i>

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:49.080
<i>Even though that's not what you want.</i>

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:04.640
<i>Mother and Hiiragizawa said the same thing...</i>

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:16.990
<i>Power that's too strong will bring 
unhappiness to its owner.</i>

00:22:25.390 --> 00:22:27.200
Syaoran-kun?

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:31.440
<i>I won't let you be unhappy...</i>

00:22:32.340 --> 00:22:33.410
<i>I swear it!</i>

00:24:10.030 --> 00:24:12.140
Hidey-howdy-ho!

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:12.970
<b>Leave It to Kero-chan!</b>

00:24:12.960 --> 00:24:15.540
The foghorn is calling me. 
It's "Leave It to Kero-chan!"

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:19.600
<b>Bear      Cat</b>

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:19.600
<b>K</b>

00:24:15.540 --> 00:24:20.200
Today, I'll introduce all the Clear Cards we've 
seen so far. Do you remember 'em all?!

00:24:19.600 --> 00:24:20.600
<b>Gale Siege Aqua Reflect 
Action Gravitation Record 
Flight Lucid Spiral 
Snooze Labyrinth Reversal 
Hail Mirage Swing 
Struggle Appear Blaze Mirror</b>

00:24:20.590 --> 00:24:22.420
Gale, Siege, Aqua, and Reflect,

00:24:22.420 --> 00:24:26.120
Action, Gravitation, Record, Flight, 
Lucid, Spiral, Snooze, and Labyrinth,

00:24:26.120 --> 00:24:28.250
Reversal, Hail, Mirage, Swing, and Struggle,

00:24:28.250 --> 00:24:31.470
Appear, Blaze, Mirror! 
Exactly twenty in all!

00:24:31.470 --> 00:24:35.430
Man, she's collected a lot. Sometimes, 
she got two or three in one episode.

00:24:31.990 --> 00:24:37.280
<b>Bear      Cat</b>

00:24:31.990 --> 00:24:37.280
<b>K</b>

00:24:35.430 --> 00:24:38.150
She has some for wind, 
water, and fire now, too.

00:24:38.150 --> 00:24:39.990
Ta-ta!

00:24:40.000 --> 00:24:42.000
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:24:40.810 --> 00:24:43.710
I was in my room, drying my 
hair in the evening,

00:24:43.710 --> 00:24:47.500
when I saw that robed person from 
my dream, outside the window.

00:24:48.540 --> 00:24:51.500
Next time, "Sakura's Clear Cards."

00:24:48.920 --> 00:24:55.010
<b>Sakura's Clear Cards</b>

00:24:51.500 --> 00:24:54.680
Say it with me: "Release!"

00:24:55.010 --> 00:25:00.010
<b>End</b>
